## `export_refute_simp`

``` hol4
Refute.export_refute_simp : string -> unit
```

Exports the named theorem to the persistent Refute simplifier set,
whose clauses the model finder uses as a constant's equations.

Every conjunct's conclusion must be `c t1 ... tn = u`, `c t1 ... tn`,
or `~(c t1 ... tn)`, with a constant head `c`: the model finder looks
the clause up by that head.  A clause with no constant head is dropped
with a warning when the model finder builds its tables, not at export.
